[2026-02-02T19:46:10.087+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:10 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.torinotoday.it/eventi/attraversamenti-accademia-albertina-2-febbraio.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
 'city': 'Torino',
